    "summary": "Each player makes **[pile-in moves](vsdata:core-rule/pile-in-move)** with any units they choose that its Eligible If section allows:\n\n1. The active player resolves all of theirs.\n2. Then the opponent resolves all of theirs.\n\nPlayers do not alternate, and no unit can pile in more than once in this step.",
